.TH tkunotes n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkunotes \- hierarchical notes widget
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkunotes
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkunotes::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A notes tree with an editor, built on the tclutils tunotes engine (requires
tclutils 0.30.0+). See docs/tkunotes.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n), tunotes
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, notes, tree
